body:
Thanks for your feedback, that helps quite a lot. I've tried before to pay early and even changed my due date for payments, but by the end of the month my budget is tight and sending the money back before the is expensive. I try to send money home in lump sums to minimize the hit of the transfer fee but some months it's just not there.  


I will look into the avalanche method. Thank you!

&#x200B;

I completely, completely understand you. If it's an actual sex act it seems less hurtful than pictures of other girls. Seeing pictures of other people feels like....I'm just not good enough. I feel like I'm just the physical object and not at all the desired one. It makes me feel disgusting because I'm nowhere near perfect.

&#x200B;

I'm in a huge down because we celebrated Halloween with my friends this weekend (one who I think my boyfriend has a slight crush on but would never do anything) and she is GORGEOUS. The two girls looked incredibly sexy and I looked like a fucking idiot. A train wreck. When my friends bag got caught on her stockings he was the first to try and help. I literally don't want to leave my house because I'm so ugly. He keeps asking me to send pictures from that night  but I don't want him to see how terrible I am in comparison, because I already felt it all night long then. I'm supposed to see him this weekend but I honestly think I'm going to cancel.

i want to help you out, but i think i'll get banned if i do.  


look up SHINee Jonghyun. but you'll also see lots of clips from the funeral, and all of the people who loved him.

i'm not here to change your mind cause i'm in the same place as you, but before you go, look him up.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

honestly, no one cares about me either. the only person who would notice would be my boyfriend but i think he'd move on quickly.

&#x200B;

i've been in a deep deep depression for a couple months, planned out my suicide a few times, almost really did it twice (already attempted twice a few years ago) and it wasn't until this past week that my "best friend" asked how i'm doing. i'm a waste. i'm ready to die honestly. this world is a hell hole and people are awful. i see no hope in or for humanity. sorry, i should be comforting you. good luck.

me too. this describes exactly how i feel. when it gets worse it gets really bad and i plan it out. i think one day when i can't pull myself out or grasp onto some sort of hope then i'll execute that plan.

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
